## Nmap scripts

Web-focused scripts:

```bash
nmap -p 80,443 --script http-title,http-headers,http-enum TARGET
```

SMB-focused scripts:

```bash
nmap -p 445 --script smb-os-discovery,smb-enum-shares TARGET
```

Safe discovery scripts:

```bash
