## Hash identification and password recovery

Identify a hash type:

```bash
hashid hash.txt
```

Try a wordlist against an authorised lab hash:

```bash
john --wordlist=/usr/share/wordlists/rockyou.txt hash.txt
```

Show recovered results:

```bash
john --show hash.txt
```

Never use password-recovery tools against accounts or data you do not own or have permission to test.

