## File transfer in a lab

On Kali, share the current folder:

```bash
python3 -m http.server 8000
```

From an authorised Linux target, download a file:

```bash
wget http://LHOST:8000/filename
```

Or:

```bash
curl http://LHOST:8000/filename -o filename
```

Stop the Python server with `Ctrl + C`.

